{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2110248752569360384"]}, "author_id": "62762183", "created_at": "2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2110248778200682765"], "id": "2110248778200682765", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 677, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA", "url": "https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"}, {"author_id": "3868003454", "created_at": "2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109912846398271869"], "id": "2109912846398271869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 63, "impression_count": 4344, "like_count": 108, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 11}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2109684043096965608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ", "url": "https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2109328149372940288", "3_2109328149389729792", "3_2109328149414817793", "3_2109328149406515200"]}, "author_id": "1138322180008136704", "created_at": "2026-10-11T17:00:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109328252062113979"], "id": "2109328252062113979", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2477, "like_count": 109, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Attended the auspicious inauguration ceremony of the Durga Puja organised by New Town Sarbojanin Durgotsav Samiti.\n\nJai Maa Durga! 🙏 https://t.co/S09cxD6mvf", "url": "https://x.com/DrSukantaBJP/status/2109328252062113979"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2109319630502408192"]}, "author_id": "3052237998", "created_at": "2026-10-11T16:26:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2109319665734586806"], "id": "2109319665734586806", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 1525, "like_count": 83, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 14}, "text": "Pandal-hopping begins! 🌸\nIn its fifth year, New Town Sarbojanin presents its theme, ‘Padma Bhushan’. 21 boats adorned with lotus flowers, accompanied by the buzzing of bees, create a unique visual spectacle. ✨ https://t.co/fhneDFRqwo", "url": "https://x.com/abirghoshal/status/2109319665734586806"}], "includes": {"media": [{"height": 1350, "media_key": "3_2110248752569360384", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUkcD1SboAAx54c.jpg", "width": 1080}, {"height": 1366, "media_key": "3_2109328149372940288", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXWxrIbMAAewFy.jpg", "width": 2048}, {"height": 1366, "media_key": "3_2109328149389729792", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXWxrMbYAA_Iax.jpg", "width": 2048}, {"height": 1366, "media_key": "3_2109328149414817793", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXWxrSaMAE2Amm.jpg", "width": 2048}, {"height": 1366, "media_key": "3_2109328149406515200", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUXWxrQbgAAvN7L.jpg", "width": 2048}, {"height": 1024, "media_key": "13_2109319630502408192", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2109319630502408192/img/2Ivyc1Emyp45mcXU.jpg", "type": "video", "width": 576}], "users": [{"id": "62762183", "name": "Open Magazine", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/716939884523446272/FCh9hb4U_normal.jpg", "username": "Openthemag"}, {"id": "3868003454", "name": "The Educated Moron", "profi